<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <meta name="robots" content="noindex" />
  <title><%= productName %> · Marketing Lab</title>
  <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/assets/obramateLogoSmallTransp.png" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@500;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/css/lab-hub.css?v=20261015-lab1" />
</head>
<body>
  <header class="hub-top">
    <a href="/" class="hub-logo"><img src="/assets/obramate-logo.png" alt="<%= productName %>" height="28" /></a>
    <span class="hub-badge">Marketing Lab · experiments</span>
    <a href="/" class="hub-back">← Production home</a>
  </header>

  <main class="hub">
    <p class="hub-kicker">Three directions. Same product. Pick one to open.</p>
    <h1>Test something totally different</h1>
    <p class="hub-lead">Production <code>/</code> stays as-is. These rooms are only for comparison.</p>

    <div class="hub-grid">
      <a class="hub-card hub-card--cinema" href="/lab/cinema">
        <span class="hub-n">01</span>
        <h2>Cinema de obra</h2>
        <p>Full-bleed atmosphere. Almost no UI chrome. One story, one CTA.</p>
        <span class="hub-go">Open room →</span>
      </a>
      <a class="hub-card hub-card--demo" href="/lab/demo">
        <span class="hub-n">02</span>
        <h2>Demo é a página</h2>
        <p>You use a mini workspace first. The trial is the next click after the “aha”.</p>
        <span class="hub-go">Open room →</span>
      </a>
      <a class="hub-card hub-card--manifesto" href="/lab/manifesto">
        <span class="hub-n">03</span>
        <h2>Manifesto mínimo</h2>
        <p>Dark petroleum. One sentence. Brand as the hero. Nothing else in the first viewport.</p>
        <span class="hub-go">Open room →</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
